      "id": "tab3",
      "title": "Đọc 例文(れいぶん) (ví dụ)",
      "titleHtml": "Đọc <ruby>例文<rp>(</rp><rt>れいぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> (ví dụ)",
      "contentHtml": "</p> <p> <audio controls preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/011111100002.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> <span>１．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai4_rb_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> <ruby>何時<rp>(</rp><rt>なんじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Bây giờ là mấy giờ?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip;２<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>10<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;2 giờ 10 phút.</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> ニューヨークは <ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> <ruby>何時<rp>(</rp><rt>なんじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Ở New York bây giờ là mấy giờ?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip;<ruby>午前<rp>(</rp><rt>ごぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> ０<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>１０<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;0 giờ 10 phút sáng.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span>２．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai4_rb_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>休<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みは <ruby>何曜日<rp>(</rp><rt>なんようび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Ngày nghỉ là thứ mấy?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip;<ruby>土曜日<rp>(</rp><rt>どようび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と <ruby>日曜日<rp>(</rp><rt>にちようび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Thứ bảy và chủ nhật.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span>３．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai4_rb_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>アップル<ruby>銀行<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は <ruby>何時<rp>(</rp><rt>なんじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から <ruby>何時<rp>(</rp><rt>なんじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>までですか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Ngân hàng Apple mở cửa từ mấy giờ đến mấy giờ?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip;９じから ３じまでです。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Từ 9 giờ đến 3 giờ.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span>４．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai4_rb_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>毎晩<rp>(</rp><rt>まいばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> <ruby>何時<rp>(</rp><rt>なんじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>寝<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ますか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Hàng tối anh/chị đi ngủ vào lúc mấy giờ?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip;１１<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>寝<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ます。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Tôi đi ngủ lúc 11 giờ.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span>５．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai4_rb_4.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>毎日<rp>(</rp><rt>まいにち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> <ruby>何時<rp>(</rp><rt>なんじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から <ruby>何時<rp>(</rp><rt>なんじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで <ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しますか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Mỗi ngày học từ mấy giờ đến mấy giờ vậy?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip;<ruby>朝<rp>(</rp><rt>あさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> ９じから <ruby>午後<rp>(</rp><rt>ごご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> ３じまで <ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>します。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Tôi học từ 9 giờ sáng đến 3 giờ chiều.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span>６．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai4_rb_4.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>土曜日<rp>(</rp><rt>どようび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> <ruby>働<rp>(</rp><rt>はたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きますか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Thứ bảy anh/chị có làm việc không?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip;いいえ、<ruby>働<rp>(</rp><rt>はたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きません。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Không, tôi không làm việc.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span>７．</span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai4_rb_5.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>きのう <ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しましたか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Hôm qua anh/chị có học không?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> &hellip;いいえ、<ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しませんでした。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Không, tôi đã không học.</div></div></div></p> <p> </div>",
